  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Quel che ci vuole nella vita... è un rivale!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750065006C0020006300680065002000630069002000760075006F006C00650020006E0065006C006C006100200076006900740061002E002E002E002000E800200075006E00200072006900760061006C00650021002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Altroché!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C00740072006F0063006800E900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tutto a posto?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500740074006F0020006100200070006F00730074006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, eccome!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C0020006500630063006F006D0065002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Niente affatto!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00690065006E007400650020006100660066006100740074006F002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quindi sarai tu <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ؆il miola mia rivale!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750069006E00640069002000730061007200610069002000740075002000100003110000FF06060069006C0020006D0069006F006C00610020006D0069006100200072006900760061006C0065002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mi rendo conto di essere fastidioso,\nma ti prego, ascoltami!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0069002000720065006E0064006F00200063006F006E0074006F002000640069002000650073007300650072006500200066006100730074006900640069006F0073006F002C000A006D006100200074006900200070007200650067006F002C0020006100730063006F006C00740061006D0069002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Immagina questo: siamo nati lo stesso giorno,\ne abbiamo deciso di allenare lo stesso Pokémon,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nCharcadet.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Per inciso, Charcadet può evolversi in due specie\ndiverse in base allo strumento utilizzato!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ma torniamo a noi: ovviamente non potevamo\nrimanere entrambi per sempre con un Charcadet.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nChe rivali saremmo stati, altrimenti?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Così abbiamo fatto evolvere i nostri Charcadet,\nUno in Armarouge e l’altro in Ceruledge!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "E poi, un giorno...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500200070006F0069002C00200075006E002000670069006F0072006E006F002E002E002E00100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... il destino ha voluto che le nostre strade si\nincontrassero di nuovo per far lottare Armarouge<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ne Ceruledge e stabilire chi è il migliore!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 148
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Storia emozionante, eh? Peccato che non\nabbia né un rivale, né tantomeno un amico<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nnato il mio stesso giorno!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPer questo vorrei che fossi tu a farne le veci!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 8,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 167
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tranquill<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa! Ho sia un’Armatura infausta che\nun’Armatura fausta per far evolvere Charcadet.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ti darò una delle due. Tu in cambio aiutami\na far diventare realtà la lotta dei miei sogni!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Scegli quale armatura vuoi e fammi sapere!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 8,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006300650067006C00690020007100750061006C0065002000610072006D00610074007500720061002000760075006F006900200065002000660061006D006D00690020007300610070006500720065002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hai scelto quale armatura vuoi?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006100690020007300630065006C0074006F0020007100750061006C0065002000610072006D00610074007500720061002000760075006F0069003F00100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’Armatura fausta",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C201900410072006D0061007400750072006100200066006100750073007400610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’Armatura infausta",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C201900410072006D0061007400750072006100200069006E0066006100750073007400610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ancora no...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E0063006F007200610020006E006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sulle tue spalle grava il peso d’una lotta voluta\ndal destino! È giusto che ti prenda del tempo<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nper riflettere!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 119
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’Armatura fausta... Farai evolvere Charcadet\nin Armarouge, dunque!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C201900410072006D006100740075007200610020006600610075007300740061002E002E002E002000460061007200610069002000650076006F006C00760065007200650020004300680061007200630061006400650074000A0069006E002000410072006D00610072006F007500670065002C002000640075006E007100750065002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allora io userò l’Armatura infausta per farlo\nevolvere in Ceruledge!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C006F0072006100200069006F0020007500730065007200F20020006C201900410072006D0061007400750072006100200069006E00660061007500730074006100200070006500720020006600610072006C006F000A00650076006F006C007600650072006500200069006E00200043006500720075006C0065006400670065002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Andiamo, Charcadet! Permeati del potere\ndelle lame cerulee!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E006400690061006D006F002C002000430068006100720063006100640065007400210020005000650072006D0065006100740069002000640065006C00200070006F0074006500720065000A00640065006C006C00650020006C0061006D006500200063006500720075006C00650065002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Affronterai il mio Ceruledge con il tuo Armarouge,\nuno contro uno!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006600660072006F006E0074006500720061006900200069006C0020006D0069006F00200043006500720075006C006500640067006500200063006F006E00200069006C002000740075006F002000410072006D00610072006F007500670065002C000A0075006E006F00200063006F006E00740072006F00200075006E006F002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ceruu!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006500720075007500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’Armatura infausta... Farai evolvere Charcadet\nin Ceruledge, dunque!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C201900410072006D0061007400750072006100200069006E006600610075007300740061002E002E002E002000460061007200610069002000650076006F006C00760065007200650020004300680061007200630061006400650074000A0069006E00200043006500720075006C0065006400670065002C002000640075006E007100750065002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allora io userò l’Armatura fausta per farlo\nevolvere in Armarouge!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C006F0072006100200069006F0020007500730065007200F20020006C201900410072006D00610074007500720061002000660061007500730074006100200070006500720020006600610072006C006F000A00650076006F006C007600650072006500200069006E002000410072006D00610072006F007500670065002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Andiamo, Charcadet! Il potere della fiamma\nvermiglia diverrà parte di te!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Affronterai il mio Armarouge con il tuo Ceruledge,\nuno contro uno!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006600660072006F006E0074006500720061006900200069006C0020006D0069006F002000410072006D00610072006F00750067006500200063006F006E00200069006C002000740075006F00200043006500720075006C0065006400670065002C000A0075006E006F00200063006F006E00740072006F00200075006E006F002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Armaaa!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410072006D00610061006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ceruledge contro Armarouge...\nUna sfida voluta dal destino!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006500720075006C006500640067006500200063006F006E00740072006F002000410072006D00610072006F007500670065002E002E002E000A0055006E006100200073006600690064006100200076006F006C007500740061002000640061006C002000640065007300740069006E006F002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eccomi!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500630063006F006D006900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un momento...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Una sfida tra due Ceruledge non ha senso.\nDev’essere tra Ceruledge e Armarouge!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Giusto, del resto una lotta simile non va affrontata\na cuor leggero. Aspetterò che tu ti senta pront<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 113
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Finalmente Ceruledge e Armarouge potranno\naffrontarsi in una lotta voluta dal destino!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nE io potrò realizzare lo scenario dei miei sogni!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non avrei mai immaginato che ci saremmo rivisti\nin queste circostanze...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E0020006100760072006500690020006D0061006900200069006D006D006100670069006E00610074006F002000630068006500200063006900200073006100720065006D006D006F00200072006900760069007300740069000A0069006E002000710075006500730074006500200063006900720063006F007300740061006E007A0065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh... Quindi hai fatto evolvere il tuo Charcadet in\nArmarouge.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450068002E002E002E0020005100750069006E00640069002000680061006900200066006100740074006F002000650076006F006C007600650072006500200069006C002000740075006F002000430068006100720063006100640065007400200069006E000A00410072006D00610072006F007500670065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>...\nRicordi la prima lotta dei nostri Charcadet?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002E002E002E000A005200690063006F0072006400690020006C00610020007000720069006D00610020006C006F00740074006100200064006500690020006E006F00730074007200690020004300680061007200630061006400650074003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ho vinto io!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F002000760069006E0074006F00200069006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hai vinto tu",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800610069002000760069006E0074006F0020007400750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Può darsi... Ma io ne ho fatta di strada da allora.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050007500F2002000640061007200730069002E002E002E0020004D006100200069006F0020006E006500200068006F002000660061007400740061002000640069002000730074007200610064006100200064006100200061006C006C006F00720061002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Proprio così! Ma sono certo che tu sia diventat<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa\npiù forte da allora.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Questa sarà la nostra sfida definitiva...\nE si concluderà con la vittoria mia e di Ceruledge!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Andiamo, Ceruledge! Sfodera le tue lame cerulee!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E006400690061006D006F002C00200043006500720075006C00650064006700650021002000530066006F00640065007200610020006C006500200074007500650020006C0061006D006500200063006500720075006C0065006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dai, affronta il mio Ceruledge solo con il tuo\nArmarouge!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
